  - zig/src/core/lanes/stream.zig       constraint pointer
  - zig/src/core/engine_api.zig         grammar/type surface, request constraint
  - zig/src/core/lane_host.zig          matcher propagation, drafts disabled
  - zig/src/families/dsv41/lanes.zig    masks applied before prefill/verify draws
  - zig/src/native/cuda.zig             conditional structures capability
  - zig/src/server/server.zig           validation before streaming
  - zig/src/server/chat.zig             matcher lifetime, unsupported combinations
  - zig/src/server/model_text.zig       tokenizer JSON callback
